-- Full Stage 2 stored-configuration checker. READ ONLY: no application data is changed.
-- Run in SSMS against EEMSuite_Northlake, or:
-- sqlcmd -S . -d EEMSuite_Northlake -E -C -I -b -f 65001 -i checks.sql -y 0
-- (-f 65001 reads this UTF-8 file as UTF-8; without it the degree sign in Degrees - (°) compares as Â°.)
-- First row = overall PASS/FAIL/WARN; section summaries follow, then exact discrepancies.
-- Required inventory: 4 custom units with their measure types and conversions (plus 10 existing units reused or extended),
-- 51 accounts with status, notes and addresses, 5 sites, 15 buildings, 336 meters with keywords, status and notes, 397 entered points,
-- 134 delta children, 6 HDD/CDD children, 15 weather assignments, 11 aggregates / 172 members.
-- The Ridgeline Wind Site (added 2026-10-01) accounts for 1 site, 2 buildings, 2 accounts, 14 meters (one a logical billing
-- meter holding the farm aggregate), 72 points, 4 aggregates.
-- Baselines are checked in Stage 3 (Baseline For needs the measured point's gateway).
-- Units compare as the editor shows them: "Name - (abbreviation)". A register keeps Reading; its Delta takes the usage unit.
-- Temperature parents are hourly; IndexPoints_Save generates DAILY (1440-minute) HDD/CDD children, in (C) units under degC.
-- The 11 aggregate points are ADDITIONAL to the 537 ordinary/generated points (548 once all steps are complete).
-- Department is checked where it is assigned (each site) and as each building shows it (inherited). Sites and buildings
-- also check level, Site/Building Code, building status and node notes; an empty page in the YAML must stay empty.
-- Correct inherited weather mappings are accepted.
-- Legacy airport buildings are optional; KSAC/KSMF may be below Weather Reference or their matching airport building.
-- A missing aggregation calculation registration is a WARN for the documented DBAdmin limitation, never a required absence.
-- This checks configuration, not data ingestion, calculation output or interactive authorization behavior.
-- After changing YAML, refresh snapshots: python -m generators.stage_check_data (from repo root).
SET NOCOUNT ON;
-- Only session-local comparison tables are written.
DROP TABLE IF EXISTS #StageCheckExpected,#StageCheckActual,#StageCheckAdditional,#StageCheckIssues;
DECLARE @Stage int=2, @ShowDetails bit=1;
DECLARE @ExpectedSnapshot nvarchar(max),@ActualSnapshot nvarchar(max),@AdditionalSnapshot nvarchar(max);
